abstract: >-
  Core implementation of a UAV-VLM-UGV task-planning workflow that converts
  aerial imagery into task-oriented semantic zones, transforms image-space
  coordinates into metric coordinates, and generates geometry- and risk-aware
  UGV routes using hierarchical path planning.
